<h2 class="mt-14">Consent and purchaser suppression for Order tracking</h2>
<p>Hold the order tracking launch until consent is documented per app and purchase events suppress order tracking promos immediately after checkout — both verifiable in an audit. Order Tracking audiences forgive plain creative; they do not forgive promos sent mid-refund or right after checkout.</p>
