<h2 class="mt-12">Margin, app costs, and pricing for Order tracking</h2>
<p>Judge order tracking on margin, not attribution. A durable order tracking program absorbs subscription, overages, SMS, capture, creative, agency, and discount costs and still pays. If order tracking tooling eats toward fifteen percent of attributed margin, reduce order tracking scope before optimizing flows.</p>
<p>Pricing changes frequently and varies by region, contact volume, and contract term, so check the official pricing pages of every shortlisted app and model an eighteen-month total that includes a peak season. Order Tracking free tiers look generous until one limit bites — verify which of contacts, sends, branching, or support constrains order tracking first.</p>
